{"id": "2da21860-d038-4e84-ab13-ea44c8a6b1f6", "slug": "network-uplink-terminal", "title": "Network Uplink Terminal", "description": "Network Uplink Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Network Uplink Terminal\"\ndescription: \"Network Uplink Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#755A30\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#FFE6C8\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#755A30\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Network Uplink Terminal\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 0; favorites: 0; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated.\n## Overview\nNetwork Uplink Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nUPLINK SYS. NODE-99 DATA LINK NODE EU-1 SRV-1 92 % ONLINE/STABLE PING 14 MS LOSS 0 % NODE SELECTOR CPU MEM NET\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #755A30, secondary #000000, accent #FFE6C8, background #000000, surface #755A30, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Network Uplink Terminal</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"m-0 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden font-mono select-none [-webkit-user-drag:none]\" style=\"\n  --chassis-base: #4d3a2b;\n  --chassis-dark: #2a1e16;\n  --chassis-highlight: #6e5845;\n  --metal-light: #fdfaf0;\n  --metal-mid: #e2d1b0;\n  --metal-dark: #b39264;\n  --screen-bg: #140d08;\n  --phosphor-amber: #c8a96e;\n  --phosphor-dim: #755a30;\n  --text-dim: #9c846d;\n  --radius-outer: 24px;\n  --radius-inner: 8px;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #5c4a3a 0%, #1a140f 100%);\n\">\n\n<div class=\"relative grid items-stretch origin-center scale-[0.5] sm:scale-[0.7] md:scale-100 z-10\" style=\"\n  width: 680px; height: 320px;\n  background: var(--chassis-base);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-outer);\n  grid-template-columns: 320px 180px 100px;\n  gap: 20px; padding: 24px;\n  box-shadow: 0 60px 100px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 12px 0 #1e1610, 0 13px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,230,200,0.15), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n\">\n  <canvas id=\"body-noise\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-[1]\" style=\"border-radius: var(--radius-outer); mix-blend-mode: soft-light; opacity: 0.5;\"></canvas>\n\n  <div class=\"absolute text-xs tracking-widest font-semibold z-[2]\" style=\"color: #1a140f; text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05); top: 12px; right: 24px;\">NODE-99</div>\n\n  <div class=\"relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden z-[5]\" style=\"\n    background: var(--chassis-dark);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-inner);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 0 0 1px #000, 0 1px 1px rgba(255,230,200,0.05);\n    padding: 12px;\n  \">\n    <div class=\"absolute overflow-hidden\" style=\"inset: 2px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--screen-bg); box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\">\n      <canvas id=\"crt-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-[1]\"></canvas>\n      <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 top-0 bottom-1/2 pointer-events-none z-[10]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,240,220,0.05) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"absolute flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none z-[2]\" style=\"inset: 16px; color: var(--phosphor-amber); text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(200, 169, 110, 0.4);\">\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-baseline\">\n          <div class=\"text-xs tracking-widest font-light\" style=\"color: var(--phosphor-dim);\">NODE EU-1</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs tracking-widest font-light\" id=\"val-node\" style=\"color: var(--phosphor-dim);\">SRV-1</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-auto mb-[20px]\">\n          <div class=\"text-4xl font-extralight tracking-tight leading-none\"><span id=\"val-load\">92</span>%</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs tracking-widest font-light mt-1\" id=\"val-status\" style=\"color: var(--phosphor-dim);\">ONLINE/STABLE</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-baseline\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs tracking-widest font-light\" style=\"color: var(--phosphor-dim);\">PING</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xl font-light\"><span id=\"val-ping\">14</span><span class=\"text-xs font-light ml-1\" style=\"color: var(--phosphor-dim);\">MS</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-right\">\n            <div class=\"text-xs tracking-widest font-light\" style=\"color: var(--phosphor-dim);\">LOSS</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xl font-light\"><span id=\"val-loss\">0</span><span class=\"text-xs font-light ml-1\" style=\"color: var(--phosphor-dim);\">%</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center z-[5]\">\n    <div class=\"relative rounded-full p-[6px]\" style=\"\n      width: 140px; height: 140px; background: #1c140e;\n      box-shadow: inset 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.05), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,230,200,0.05);\n    \">\n      <div id=\"main-dial\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full rounded-full cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing\" style=\"\n        transform: rotate(var(--rotation, 0deg));\n        background: repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, var(--metal-light) 0, var(--metal-light) 1px, var(--metal-mid) 1.5px, var(--metal-mid) 2.5px);\n      \">\n        <div class=\"absolute flex items-center justify-center rounded-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\" style=\"\n          top: 12px; width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #4d3a2b; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n        \">\n          <div class=\"rounded-full w-1 h-1\" style=\"background: #c8a96e;\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"absolute rounded-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"\n        inset: 6px; mix-blend-mode: soft-light;\n        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.7) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 100%), conic-gradient(from 180deg at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 270deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 315deg, rgba(255,255,255,0) 360deg);\n        box-shadow: -4px -4px 8px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), 12px 16px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), inset 0 2px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n      \"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mt-[20px] text-xs tracking-widest font-light text-center\" style=\"color: var(--text-dim);\">NODE SELECTOR</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between pb-[20px] z-[5]\">\n    <div class=\"flex justify-end gap-[8px] pt-[8px]\">\n      <div id=\"status-led\" data-active=\"false\" class=\"w-[8px] h-[8px] rounded-full transition-all duration-100 bg-[#1a140f] shadow-[inset_0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9),0_1px_0_rgba(255,230,200,0.05)] data-[active=true]:bg-[#ffcc66] data-[active=true]:shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8),0_0_12px_#ffcc66]\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[6px] p-[6px] rounded-xl\" style=\"\n      background: #2a1e16; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,230,200,0.05);\n    \">\n      <button data-selected=\"true\" class=\"btn h-[44px] rounded-md text-xs font-medium cursor-pointer transition-all duration-75 border-none font-mono bg-[#443427] text-[#9c846d] shadow-[0_3px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5),inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),inset_0_-1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] active:translate-y-[2px] active:shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] hover:bg-[#4d3a2b] data-[selected=true]:bg-[#755a30] data-[selected=true]:text-[#f2e1c1] data-[selected=true]:shadow-[inset_0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),0_0_8px_rgba(117,90,48,0.4)] data-[selected=true]:translate-y-[1px]\">CPU</button>\n      <button data-selected=\"false\" class=\"btn h-[44px] rounded-md text-xs font-medium cursor-pointer transition-all duration-75 border-none font-mono bg-[#443427] text-[#9c846d] shadow-[0_3px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5),inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),inset_0_-1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] active:translate-y-[2px] active:shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] hover:bg-[#4d3a2b] data-[selected=true]:bg-[#755a30] data-[selected=true]:text-[#f2e1c1] data-[selected=true]:shadow-[inset_0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),0_0_8px_rgba(117,90,48,0.4)] data-[selected=true]:translate-y-[1px]\">MEM</button>\n      <button data-selected=\"false\" class=\"btn h-[44px] rounded-md text-xs font-medium cursor-pointer transition-all duration-75 border-none font-mono bg-[#443427] text-[#9c846d] shadow-[0_3px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5),inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),inset_0_-1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] active:translate-y-[2px] active:shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] hover:bg-[#4d3a2b] data-[selected=true]:bg-[#755a30] data-[selected=true]:text-[#f2e1c1] data-[selected=true]:shadow-[inset_0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),0_0_8px_rgba(117,90,48,0.4)] data-[selected=true]:translate-y-[1px]\">NET</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst serverData = [\n  { node: 'SRV-1', load: 92, ping: 14, loss: 0,  status: 'ONLINE/STABLE', amp: 0.1, freq: 8.0 },\n  { node: 'SRV-2', load: 45, ping: 8,  loss: 0,  status: 'ONLINE/OPTML',  amp: 0.05, freq: 4.0 },\n  { node: 'SRV-3', load: 99, ping: 128, loss: 12, status: 'WARN/OVERLOAD', amp: 0.4, freq: 15.0 },\n  { node: 'SRV-4', load: 100, ping: 999, loss: 80, status: 'ERR/TIMEOUT',   amp: 0.8, freq: 25.0 },\n  { node: 'SRV-5', load: 78, ping: 42, loss: 2,  status: 'DEGRADED/NET',  amp: 0.3, freq: 10.0 },\n  { node: 'SRV-6', load: 60, ping: 15, loss: 0,  status: 'ONLINE/SYNC',   amp: 0.15, freq: 6.0 },\n  { node: 'SRV-7', load: 88, ping: 20, loss: 0,  status: 'ONLINE/STABLE', amp: 0.1, freq: 8.0 },\n];\n\nlet currentIndex = 0;\nlet targetAmp = serverData[0].amp;\nlet targetFreq = serverData[0].freq;\nlet currentAmp = targetAmp;\nlet currentFreq = targetFreq;\nlet glitchAmount = 0.0;\n\nconst elNode = document.getElementById('val-node');\nconst elLoad = document.getElementById('val-load');\nconst elStatus = document.getElementById('val-status');\nconst elPing = document.getElementById('val-ping');\nconst elLoss = document.getElementById('val-loss');\nconst led = document.getElementById('status-led');\nconst dial = document.getElementById('main-dial');\n\nfunction updateDOMData(index) {\n  const d = serverData[index];\n  elNode.innerText = d.node;\n  elLoad.innerText = d.load;\n  elStatus.innerText = d.status;\n  elPing.innerText = d.ping;\n  elLoss.innerText = d.loss;\n  targetAmp = d.amp;\n  targetFreq = d.freq;\n  glitchAmount = 1.0;\n  led.setAttribute('data-active', 'true');\n  setTimeout(() => led.setAttribute('data-active', 'false'), 150);\n}\n\nlet isDragging = false;\nlet startAngle = 0;\nlet currentRotation = 0;\n\nfunction calculateAngle(e, element) {\n  const rect = element.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const centerX = rect.left + rect.width / 2;\n  const centerY = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n  const clientX = e.touches ? e.touches[0].clientX : e.clientX;\n  const clientY = e.touches ? e.touches[0].clientY : e.clientY;\n  return Math.atan2(clientY - centerY, clientX - centerX) * (180 / Math.PI);\n}\n\nfunction onDragStart(e) {\n  isDragging = true;\n  startAngle = calculateAngle(e, dial) - currentRotation;\n}\n\nfunction onDragMove(e) {\n  if (!isDragging) return;\n  const angle = calculateAngle(e, dial);\n  currentRotation = angle - startAngle;\n  dial.style.setProperty('--rotation', `${currentRotation}deg`);\n  let normalized = currentRotation % 360;\n  if (normalized < 0) normalized += 360;\n  const segmentSize = 360 / 7;\n  const newIndex = Math.floor(normalized / segmentSize);\n  if (newIndex !== currentIndex) {\n    currentIndex = newIndex;\n    updateDOMData(currentIndex);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction onDragEnd() { isDragging = false; }\n\ndial.addEventListener('mousedown', onDragStart);\ndocument.addEventListener('mousemove', onDragMove);\ndocument.addEventListener('mouseup', onDragEnd);\ndial.addEventListener('touchstart', onDragStart, {passive: false});\ndocument.addEventListener('touchmove', onDragMove, {passive: false});\ndocument.addEventListener('touchend', onDragEnd);\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.btn').forEach(b => {\n  b.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.btn').forEach(btn => btn.setAttribute('data-selected', 'false'));\n    e.target.setAttribute('data-selected', 'true');\n    glitchAmount = 0.5;\n  });\n});\n\nfunction createShader(gl, type, source) {\n  const shader = gl.createShader(type);\n  gl.shaderSource(shader, source);\n  gl.compileShader(shader);\n  return shader;\n}\n\nfunction createProgram(gl, vsSource, fsSource) {\n  const vShader = createShader(gl, gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vsSource);\n  const fShader = createShader(gl, gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, fsSource);\n  const prog = gl.createProgram();\n  gl.attachShader(prog, vShader);\n  gl.attachShader(prog, fShader);\n  gl.linkProgram(prog);\n  return prog;\n}\n\nconst standardVS = `attribute vec2 position; varying vec2 vUv; void main() { gl_Position = vec4(position, 0.0, 1.0); vUv = position * 0.5 + 0.5; }`;\nconst quadBufferData = new Float32Array([-1, -1, 1, -1, -1, 1, 1, 1]);\n\nfunction initBodyNoise() {\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('body-noise');\n  const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl');\n  if (!gl) return;\n  canvas.width = canvas.clientWidth * 2;\n  canvas.height = canvas.clientHeight * 2;\n  const fs = `precision highp float; varying vec2 vUv; float random(vec2 st) { return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123); } void main() { float n = random(vUv * 5.0); gl_FragColor = vec4(vec3(0.0), n * 0.4); }`;\n  const prog = createProgram(gl, standardVS, fs);\n  gl.useProgram(prog);\n  const buffer = gl.createBuffer();\n  gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buffer);\n  gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadBufferData, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n  const posLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, \"position\");\n  gl.enableVertexAttribArray(posLoc);\n  gl.vertexAttribPointer(posLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n  gl.viewport(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);\n  gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n}\ninitBodyNoise();\n\nfunction initCRT() {\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('crt-canvas');\n  const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl', { alpha: true });\n  if (!gl) return;\n  canvas.width = canvas.clientWidth * 2;\n  canvas.height = canvas.clientHeight * 2;\n  const fs = `\n    precision highp float;\n    varying vec2 vUv;\n    uniform float u_time;\n    uniform float u_glitch;\n    uniform float u_amp;\n    uniform float u_freq;\n    float random(vec2 st) { return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123); }\n    void main() {\n      vec2 uv = vUv;\n      if (u_glitch > 0.0) uv.x += (random(vec2(uv.y * 5.0, u_time)) - 0.5) * u_glitch * 0.1;\n      vec3 color = vec3(0.08, 0.05, 0.03);\n      float grid = max(step(0.985, fract(uv.x * 15.0)), step(0.985, fract(uv.y * 10.0)));\n      color += vec3(0.2, 0.15, 0.08) * grid * (1.0 - u_glitch);\n      float t = u_time * 0.4 + u_glitch * random(uv)*0.05;\n      float waveY = sin((uv.x * u_freq) + t) * u_amp;\n      float waveDist = abs((uv.y - 0.5) - waveY);\n      float waveCore = smoothstep(0.006 + u_glitch*0.01, 0.0, waveDist);\n      vec3 waveColor = vec3(0.78, 0.66, 0.43);\n      color += waveColor * waveCore;\n      color += waveColor * 0.4 * smoothstep(0.03, 0.0, waveDist);\n      color -= sin(uv.y * 600.0 - u_time * 8.0) * 0.03;\n      color += random(uv + u_time) * 0.1;\n      color *= smoothstep(0.9, 0.4, distance(vUv, vec2(0.5)));\n      gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n    }\n  `;\n  const prog = createProgram(gl, standardVS, fs);\n  gl.useProgram(prog);\n  const buffer = gl.createBuffer();\n  gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buffer);\n  gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, quadBufferData, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n  const posLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, \"position\");\n  gl.enableVertexAttribArray(posLoc);\n  gl.vertexAttribPointer(posLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n  const uTime = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, \"u_time\");\n  const uGlitch = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, \"u_glitch\");\n  const uAmp = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, \"u_amp\");\n  const uFreq = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, \"u_freq\");\n  let startTime = Date.now();\n  function render() {\n    gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n    currentAmp += (targetAmp - currentAmp) * 0.1;\n    currentFreq += (targetFreq - currentFreq) * 0.1;\n    glitchAmount *= 0.85;\n    gl.uniform1f(uTime, (Date.now() - startTime) / 1000);\n    gl.uniform1f(uGlitch, glitchAmount);\n    gl.uniform1f(uAmp, currentAmp);\n    gl.uniform1f(uFreq, currentFreq);\n    gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n    requestAnimationFrame(render);\n  }\n  render();\n}\ninitCRT();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "network-uplink-terminal.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/network-uplink-terminal.jpg", "source_name": "network-uplink-terminal-DESIGN.md", "views": 82, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T22:04:26.849995+00:00"}